      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "5. Section 68 of the Act provides for administration by the Board as a trustee."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "88d4f9956ff945139ce74fac951c3949_18",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "STA"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "As per sub-section (1)\nof Section 68, subject to the provisions of the Act and of any other law for the time being in force,\nthe Board shall be bound to administer the affairs of incorporated and unincorporated Devaswoms and institutions un"
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "573dc6ce27d04844a7752a4c7375e9f6_19",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "STA"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "As per sub-section (2) of Section 68, notwithstanding anything contained in sub-section (1), the Board may, out of the funds under their control, set apart such sum as they deem fit for the educational uplift, cultural advancement and econo"
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "49c14defd9b54762b3d0f44cab7e9078_20",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "STA"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "\n6. Section 73A of the Act deals with the duties of the Board."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "bbc1d403b2874d0fb5807c602a3807c5_21",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "STA"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "As per Section 73A, it shall be the duty of the Board to perform the functions enumerated in clauses (i) to (iv), namely, (i) to see that the regular traditional rites according to the practice prevalent in the religious institution are per"
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "335c2b4a75b0447482da4a751a92be78_23",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "There is no dispute on this fact."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "faddd96ae68d4f64b9b48ca8d77cafc3_24",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "That being so, there cannot be any activity in Thekkinkadu Maidan, except in accordance with the objects of the trust."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "a651802df42d4cca97e053c7078ebae5_33",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "In that order dated 26.07.2023 in DBP No.35 of 2023, in continuation of the order in DBP No.32 of 2023, it was ordered that the directions contained in the judgment of this Court in K.B. Sumodh v. Commissioner, Cochin Devaswom Board and oth"
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "1c5a917d53764b0ba1ae449aefcf772b_37",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "The Circle Inspector of Police shall ensure regular patrolling by the police to ensure that Thekkinkadu Maidan, which is a Devaswom property, is not used for any illegal activities, in any manner."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "5edaa936e6ca41b7ad7d75e262b44eac_38",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "12. According to 'Agama Sastra' Hindu temples represent the culmination of social and religious aspirations of a society."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "7da9767d87104f6e80e4e7060c8bf91b_39",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "The temple is the focal point in the life of a community and often represents its pride, identity and unity."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "53cc95e66b37469fa8b3f474b6c02ccc_40",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "It draws into its fold people from its various segments and denominations and binds them together."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "51d1b5d75be2441ea08faab1d2e8156b_41",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "The worship that takes place in the sanctum sanctorum and within the temple premises is important; so are the festivals and occasional processions that involve the direct participation of the entire community."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "2c2c467c6f8a4b7c8dceb9b14de6f891_42",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "They complement each other."
    },
    {
